{"steam_appid":4286120,"steam_name":"Photomaly","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4286120/365867994/dbdcb161ef4e36b8f5d7d36eecbe22e0a3a6f18e/1784640438/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784643114","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257381724/e2c3419f539f2a925c7146ccc6901364df139bd0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784643114","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/b799fa3a240554918e7cbb6ffef59abb701e3fab/ss_b799fa3a240554918e7cbb6ffef59abb701e3fab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785764223","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/601bc47d5e3f43ec5f5aff46a8c3a294a6367d79/ss_601bc47d5e3f43ec5f5aff46a8c3a294a6367d79.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785764223","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/b98f1d184142135ff201452aa7f6b9be144cba93/ss_b98f1d184142135ff201452aa7f6b9be144cba93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785764223","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/1cca9d8fdb019fcf0fcd13ae7e42fefc5734f7a1/ss_1cca9d8fdb019fcf0fcd13ae7e42fefc5734f7a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785764223","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/2360ad09927bd4ac540331f70953c2c197770c46/ss_2360ad09927bd4ac540331f70953c2c197770c46.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785764223"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photomaly is PSX-style first-person horror game where you take over the photography studio your father left behind. Process orders from strange customers, decorate your studio and keep an eye out for things that don’t seem quite right... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/bf06f3272931111e0a6ed69660bbe2e4.avif?t=1785764223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras_big/bf06f3272931111e0a6ed69660bbe2e4.webp?t=1785764223 width=1560 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/dba2177c3ba517130309b1dfbf2cd162.poster.avif?t=1785764223\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/dba2177c3ba517130309b1dfbf2cd162.webm?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/dba2177c3ba517130309b1dfbf2cd162.mp4?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photography isn’t always as simple as pressing the shutter. Find the perfect angle, develop film under the right conditions, prepare the final photos, and make sure they end up in the right hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/4121c8815d22bf079cecaf92a1111cfa.avif?t=1785764223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras_big/4121c8815d22bf079cecaf92a1111cfa.webp?t=1785764223 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/68b19c5fad339c9167c530d841d210c7.poster.avif?t=1785764223\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/68b19c5fad339c9167c530d841d210c7.webm?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/68b19c5fad339c9167c530d841d210c7.mp4?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greet and serve the local community. Each customer comes with their own unique requests, quirks, and stories. Get to know your patrons and fulfil their orders. Just make sure not to pry too deep… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/069e202e884a664c46ca1515e3cd01dd.avif?t=1785764223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras_big/069e202e884a664c46ca1515e3cd01dd.webp?t=1785764223 width=1560 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/126fe8cd3868241d3def4831cd9a6bae.poster.avif?t=1785764223\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/126fe8cd3868241d3def4831cd9a6bae.webm?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/126fe8cd3868241d3def4831cd9a6bae.mp4?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When business is slow, customise and decorate your workspace. Hang your favourite prints on the wall or create the perfect wallpaper for your PC. Use your profits to unlock and purchase studio upgrades – better equipment, better setups, better results. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/639cae2e4de6dab69a6282ac566acf88.avif?t=1785764223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras_big/639cae2e4de6dab69a6282ac566acf88.webp?t=1785764223 width=1560 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/f53ede05e49fb7a9f851b04751b1e909.poster.avif?t=1785764223\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/f53ede05e49fb7a9f851b04751b1e909.webm?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4286120/extras/f53ede05e49fb7a9f851b04751b1e909.mp4?t=1785764223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developing films pays the bills, but something isn’t quite right. With every photo taken, you get a little bit closer to [REDACTED]. The [REDACTED] seems to know some things as well…  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Revira Interactive"],"publishers":["Alibi Games"],"release_date":"Jul 21, 2026"}